# The image is built from pyproject.toml, README.md, LICENSE and src/ only.
# Keeping everything else out of the build context makes the build fast (the
# repository holds hundreds of megabytes of video and website assets) and keeps
# run data, keys and experimental fixtures out of any layer.
*
!pyproject.toml
!README.md
!LICENSE
!src/
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/*.egg-info
